ty\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Irani MotoHub Golden Hour Hero\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"website\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Irani MotoHub | Premium Motorcycle Performance Parts\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Premium Motorcycle accessories and performance upgrades\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/hero-bg.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1-ypg-tqme8hc.ico\",\"sizes\":\"1024x1024\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"21\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L26\",\"22\",{}]]\n27:Tc58,<p>Terms &amp; Conditions</p>\n<p>Welcome to Irani Motohub. By accessing or using our website and placing an order, you agree to the following Terms &amp; Conditions.</p>\n<p>Products &amp; Product Information</p>\n<p>We make reasonable efforts to ensure that product descriptions, images, specifications, prices, and availability displayed on our website are accurate.</p>\n<p>However, minor differences in appearance, packaging,specifications may occur for product.</p>\n<p>Customers are responsible for ensuring that a product is suitable and compatible with their vehicle before purchasing.</p>\n<p>Orders</p>\n<p>Placing an order on our website constitutes a request to purchase the selected products.</p>\n<p>We reserve the right to accept, cancel, or refuse an order in cases including product unavailability, pricing errors, suspected fraudulent activity, or other unforeseen circumstances.</p>\n<p>Pricing &amp; Payments</p>\n<p>All product prices are displayed on the website as applicable.</p>\n<p>Payment must be completed through the available payment methods at checkout. Orders placed using Cash on Delivery are subject to the applicable COD charges mentioned in our Shipping Policy.</p>\n<p>Shipping &amp; Delivery</p>\n<p>Orders are generally dispatched within 48–72 hours after successful order confirmation.</p>\n<p>Shipping charges and delivery timelines are subject to our Shipping Policy.</p>\n<p>Vehicle Compatibility &amp; Installation</p>\n<p>Customers are responsible for confirming product compatibility with their vehicle before placing an order.</p>\n<p>Irani Motohub shall not be responsible for damage, improper installation, incorrect fitment, or performance issues resulting from installation of a product that is unsuitable for the customer’s vehicle or incorrectly installed.</p>\n<p>Professional installation is recommended where applicable.</p>\n<p>Returns, Replacements &amp; Refunds</p>\n<p>Returns, replacements, and refunds will be handled according to our applicable Return Policy.</p>\n<p>Products may be subject to eligibility requirements, including condition, packaging, and proof of purchase.</p>\n<p>Intellectual Property</p>\n<p>All website content, including logos, photographs, graphics, text, product descriptions, and other materials belonging to Irani Motohub may not be copied, reproduced, modified, or used without prior permission.</p>\n<p>Limitation of Liability</p>\n<p>Irani Motohub shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential losses arising from the use or inability to use our products or website, to the extent permitted under applicable law.</p>\n<p>Website Availability</p>\n<p>We aim to keep our website available and accurate but do not guarantee uninterrupted access or that the website will always be free from errors or technical issues.</p>\n<p>Changes to Terms</p>\n<p>Irani Motohub reserves the right to modify these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time. Updated terms will be posted on this page.</p>\n<p>Go